        "story": "Sam has a desk, a tray and a photo album. He writes Complete on a task card and places a copy in the tray for the next photograph. He then changes the card on the desk to say Pack blue bag. The tray still has the earlier copy. When he photographs the tray, the album records completion with the old title. The desk keeps the newer title until Sam chooses another photograph.",
