        "solution": "\u003cp>For a filter, keep accepted model.items unchanged and derive visibleItems in the view. Map the callback offsets through visibleItems, then delete the resulting ID set. Disable moves while the filter is active. Assert that A, B, C becomes A, B after deleting visible offset one, and that a later rename of C is rejected without adding a task.\u003c/p>\u003cp>Inject a save failure during a valid change to A. Confirm the new value remains in memory, dirty is true and reload refuses to overwrite it. Clear the injected fault and save; the latest full snapshot must include hidden B. This new integrated fixture goes beyond the supplied direct command checks.\u003c/p>\u003cp>In the native target, compile the three Core files and native App with real Observation. Record the result even if blocked. For an available run, inspect Cancel, valid Save, completion meaning, keyboard submission, large text and relaunch preserving ID/order separately. Do not infer them from compilation. Deliver the independent diff and exact outputs, then leave device interruption, protected-data and multiwriter guarantees outside the verified contract.\u003c/p>"
