        "androidBridge": "Compose remembered state and state hoisting are useful analogies for SwiftUI identity-associated State and passed bindings. SwiftUI View values are descriptions rather than retained Android View objects; Observation tracks property reads and does not equal StateFlow, persistence, or a ViewModel lifetime.",
