        "androidBridge": "Kotlin Flow, StateFlow, and channels help distinguish collection, replaceable state, and required events. AsyncSequence does not imply cold Flow behavior or multicast, and continuation-based AsyncStream.yield does not suspend the producer like a suspending channel send.",
