        "androidBridge": "Android signing keys, application IDs, variants, and release artifacts give useful comparison points. Apple provisioning profiles authorize specific identity, App ID, capabilities, and distribution combinations; entitlements and per-binary dSYM identity do not map directly to an Android signing certificate or versionCode.",
