        "androidBridge": "Android experience supplies debugging and delivery judgment that can transfer, but does not establish iOS lifecycle, isolation, signing, or device evidence. Kotlin or Java proficiency and completed exercises are learning evidence, not substitutes for observed Swift behavior or organizational staff expectations.",
